{"task_id": "Mbpp/12", "solution": "from typing import List\n\ndef compute_row_sums(matrix: List[List[int]]) -> List[int]:\n    \"\"\"Compute the sum of each row.\"\"\"\n    return [sum(row) for row in matrix]\n\ndef stable_sort_rows(matrix: List[List[int]], sums: List[int]) -> List[List[int]]:\n    \"\"\"Perform a stable sort of rows based on pre\u2011computed sums.\"\"\"\n    indexed_matrix = list(enumerate(matrix))\n    indexed_matrix.sort(key=lambda x: sums[x[0]])\n    return [row for _, row in indexed_matrix]\n\ndef sort_matrix(matrix: List[List[int]]) -> List[List[int]]:\n    \"\"\"Return a new matrix with rows sorted by ascending row sum.\"\"\"\n    sums = compute_row_sums(matrix)\n    sorted_rows = stable_sort_rows(matrix, sums)\n    return sorted_rows"}
