{"task_id": "Mbpp/61", "solution": "def count_Substrings(s):\n    \"\"\"\n    Counts the number of substrings in a given string where the sum of their digits equals their length.\n    This implementation uses a nested loop to check all possible substrings.\n    \"\"\"\n    n = len(s)\n    count = 0\n    for i in range(n):\n        current_sum = 0\n        for j in range(i, n):\n            current_sum += int(s[j])\n            current_length = j - i + 1\n            if current_sum == current_length:\n                count += 1\n    return count"}
