{"task_id": "Mbpp/160", "solution": "def egcd(a: int, b: int) -> tuple[int, int, int]:\n    \"\"\"\n    Computes (g, x, y) such that a*x + b*y = g = gcd(a, b).\n    Assumes a, b are non-negative.\n    \"\"\"\n    if a == 0:\n        return (b, 0, 1)\n    else:\n        g, x, y = egcd(b % a, a)\n        return (g, y - (b // a) * x, x)\n\ndef find_solution(a: int, b: int, n: int) -> tuple[int, int] | None:\n    \"\"\"\n    Returns integers x and y that satisfy ax + by = n as a tuple (x, y),\n    or returns None if no solution exists.\n    \"\"\"\n    # Handle special cases for zero coefficients\n    if a == 0 and b == 0:\n        return (0, 0) if n == 0 else None\n    elif a == 0: # b must be non-zero here\n        if n % b == 0:\n            x_sol = 0\n            y_sol = n // b\n            if a * x_sol + b * y_sol == n: # Verification\n                return (x_sol, y_sol)\n            else:\n                return None\n        else:\n            return None\n    elif b == 0: # a must be non-zero here\n        if n % a == 0:\n            x_sol = n // a\n            y_sol = 0\n            if a * x_sol + b * y_sol == n: # Verification\n                return (x_sol, y_sol)\n            else:\n                return None\n        else:\n            return None\n\n    # Both a and b are non-zero. Use Extended Euclidean Algorithm.\n    original_a = a\n    original_b = b\n\n    # egcd works with non-negative numbers\n    g, x_coeff, y_coeff = egcd(abs(a), abs(b))\n\n    # If n is not divisible by g (gcd), no integer solution exists\n    if n % g != 0:\n        return None\n\n    # Scale the solution from abs(a)*x_coeff + abs(b)*y_coeff = g to n\n    scale_factor = n // g\n    x_particular = x_coeff * scale_factor\n    y_particular = y_coeff * scale_factor\n\n    # Adjust signs based on original a and b\n    if original_a < 0:\n        x_particular = -x_particular\n    if original_b < 0:\n        y_particular = -y_particular\n\n    # Final verification\n    if original_a * x_particular + original_b * y_particular == n:\n        return (x_particular, y_particular)\n    else:\n        return None"}
