{"task_id": "Mbpp/162", "solution": "def sum_series(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of the series n + (n-2) + (n-4) + ... until the term <= 0.\n    \"\"\"\n    if n <= 0:\n        return 0\n\n    total = 0\n    i = 0\n    while True:\n        term = n - 2 * i\n        if term <= 0:\n            break\n        total += term\n        i += 1\n\n    return total"}
