{"task_id": "Mbpp/392", "solution": "def get_max_sum(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the maximum sum using the recurrence f(n) = max( (f(n/2) + f(n/3) + f(n/4) + f(n/5)), n).\n    Uses memoization to optimize recursive calls.\n    \"\"\"\n    memo = {}\n\n    def _f(k):\n        if k == 0:\n            return 0\n        if k in memo:\n            return memo[k]\n\n        sum_of_parts = _f(k // 2) + _f(k // 3) + _f(k // 4) + _f(k // 5)\n        result = max(sum_of_parts, k)\n        memo[k] = result\n        return result\n\n    return _f(n)"}
