{"task_id": "Mbpp/633", "solution": "def pair_xor_Sum(numbers, n):\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of XOR of all pairs of numbers in the first n elements of the list.\n    Returns 0 if n is less than 2.\n    \"\"\"\n    if n < 2:\n        return 0\n\n    total_xor_sum = 0\n    for i in range(n):\n        for j in range(i + 1, n):\n            total_xor_sum += (numbers[i] ^ numbers[j])\n            \n    return total_xor_sum"}
