{"task_id": "Mbpp/638", "solution": "import math\n\ndef wind_chill(wind_velocity_kmh: float, temperature_c: float) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the wind chill index rounded to the next integer.\n    Uses the standard meteorological formula with velocity in km/h and temperature in Celsius.\n    \"\"\"\n    v = wind_velocity_kmh\n    t = temperature_c\n    wind_chill_raw = (\n        13.12\n        + 0.6215 * t\n        - 11.37 * (v ** 0.16)\n        + 0.3965 * t * (v ** 0.16)\n    )\n    return int(math.ceil(wind_chill_raw))"}
