{"task_id": "Mbpp/745", "solution": "def divisible_by_digits(startnum, endnum):\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds numbers within a given range where every number is divisible by every digit it contains.\n    Numbers containing the digit zero are excluded.\n    \"\"\"\n    result = []\n    for num in range(startnum, endnum + 1):\n        s_num = str(num)\n        if '0' in s_num:\n            continue\n\n        is_divisible_by_all_digits = True\n        for char_digit in s_num:\n            digit = int(char_digit)\n            if num % digit != 0:\n                is_divisible_by_all_digits = False\n                break\n        \n        if is_divisible_by_all_digits:\n            result.append(num)\n            \n    return result"}
