{"task_id": "Mbpp/790", "solution": "def even_position(numbers: list[int]) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"Checks if every even index contains an even number in the given list.\"\"\"\n    for i in range(0, len(numbers), 2):\n        if not isinstance(numbers[i], int):\n            raise TypeError(f\"Element at index {i} is not an integer (found {type(numbers[i]).__name__}).\")\n        if numbers[i] % 2 != 0:\n            return False\n    return True"}
