{"task_id": "Mbpp/797", "solution": "def sum_in_range(l: int, r: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of all odd natural numbers within the inclusive range [l, r].\n    Validates inputs and uses an arithmetic series formula for efficient computation.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not isinstance(l, int) or not isinstance(r, int):\n        raise ValueError(\"Both l and r must be integers.\")\n    if l <= 0 or r <= 0:\n        raise ValueError(\"Both l and r must be natural numbers (positive integers).\")\n    if l > r:\n        raise ValueError(\"Start of range l must be less than or equal to r.\")\n\n    first_odd = l if l % 2 == 1 else l + 1\n    last_odd = r if r % 2 == 1 else r - 1\n\n    if first_odd > last_odd:\n        return 0\n\n    n = (last_odd - first_odd) // 2 + 1\n    total = n * (first_odd + last_odd) // 2\n    return total"}
