{"task_id": "Mbpp/573", "solution": "import collections\nfrom typing import List\n\ndef unique_product(numbers: List[int]) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the product of unique numbers in a given list.\n    Returns 1 for an empty list, adhering to the multiplicative identity.\n    \"\"\"\n    unique_nums = set(numbers)\n    product = 1\n    for num in unique_nums:\n        product *= num\n    return product"}
