{"task_id": "Mbpp/735", "solution": "class Number:\n    \"\"\"Internal helper representing an integer and its bit operations.\"\"\"\n    def __init__(self, value: int):\n        self.value = value\n        self.bit_length = value.bit_length()\n\n    def get_first_bit(self) -> int:\n        return (self.value >> (self.bit_length - 1)) & 1\n\n    def get_last_bit(self) -> int:\n        return self.value & 1\n\n    def get_middle_bits(self) -> int:\n        if self.bit_length <= 2:\n            return 0\n        mask = (1 << (self.bit_length - 2)) - 1\n        return (self.value >> 1) & mask\n\n    def toggle_middle_bits(self) -> int:\n        if self.bit_length <= 2:\n            return self.value\n        middle = self.get_middle_bits()\n        toggled_middle = ~middle & ((1 << (self.bit_length - 2)) - 1)\n        # Re\u2011assemble the number\n        return (self.get_first_bit() << (self.bit_length - 1)) | \\\n               (toggled_middle << 1) | \\\n               self.get_last_bit()\n\n\ndef toggle_middle_bits(value: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Toggle all bits of `value` except the most\u2011significant and least\u2011significant bits.\"\"\"\n    number = Number(value)\n    return number.toggle_middle_bits()"}
